// GI acceptance pose (REN-GI-005): a room WITH A WINDOW. The enterable farmhouse (Dum09,
// \O\Hous\zluty_statek_in) is PLACED BY THIS MISSION on the open hill at Everon 7050 / 6500,
// with the player standing in its centre. Placing it rather than hunting one in the world is
// deliberate: the remaster's Everon does not use the object coordinates Noe.pbo's WRP lists,
// so a pose keyed to those coordinates cannot be reproduced.
